# Unit10
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit10核心词汇

interfere/ˌɪntərˈfɪr/干涉/Don't interfere in other people's affairs.
internal/ɪnˈtɜːrnl/内部的/The company solved its internal problems.
interpret/ɪnˈtɜːrprɪt/解释/How do you interpret this passage?
interval/ˈɪntərvl/间隔/Buses run at 15-minute intervals.
intervene/ˌɪntərˈviːn/干预/The government intervened to stabilize the economy.
intimate/ˈɪntɪmət/亲密的/They are intimate friends.
investigate/ɪnˈvestɪɡeɪt/调查/The police are investigating the crime.
investment/ɪnˈvestmənt/投资/Real estate is a safe investment.
invisible/ɪnˈvɪzəbl/看不见的/Germs are invisible to the naked eye.
involve/ɪnˈvɑːlv/涉及/The project involves a lot of teamwork.
isolate/ˈaɪsəleɪt/隔离/The patient was isolated to prevent infection.
issue/ˈɪʃuː/问题/Climate change is an important issue today.
judgment/ˈdʒʌdʒmənt/判断/He showed good judgment in the crisis.
junior/ˈdʒuːniər/初级的/He is a junior employee in the company.
justify/ˈdʒʌstɪfaɪ/证明…正当/How can you justify such behavior?
keen/kiːn/热切的/She is keen on learning new languages.
label/ˈleɪbl/标签/Read the label before taking the medicine.
labor/ˈleɪbər/劳动力/Labor costs have increased significantly.
landscape/ˈlændskeɪp/风景/The landscape in this area is beautiful.
launch/lɔːntʃ/发射；发起/The company launched a new product last month.
layer/ˈleɪeɪr/层/The cake has three layers.
leadership/ˈliːdərʃɪp/领导力/Good leadership is essential for success.
lean/liːn/倾斜；依靠/She leaned against the wall.
legislation/ˌledʒɪsˈleɪʃn/立法/The government passed new legislation on education.
legitimate/lɪˈdʒɪtɪmət/合法的/His concerns are legitimate.
leisure/ˈliːʒər/休闲/She spends her leisure time reading books.
liberal/ˈlɪbərəl/自由的/He has liberal views on social issues.
likewise/ˈlaɪkwaɪz/同样地/She is a talented musician; likewise, she is a great painter.
link/lɪŋk/连接/There is a link between smoking and lung cancer.
literally/ˈlɪtərəli/字面上/He literally ran all the way home.
literary/ˈlɪtəreri/文学的/She has a great interest in literary works.
locate/ˈloʊkeɪt/位于/Can you locate this place on the map?
logic/ˈlɑːdʒɪk/逻辑/His argument is based on sound logic.
loyal/ˈlɔɪəl/忠诚的/He is a loyal friend.
maintain/meɪnˈteɪn/维持/We must maintain a healthy lifestyle.
majority/məˈdʒɔːrəti/多数/The majority of students passed the exam.
manifest/ˈmænɪfest/表明/The symptoms manifested themselves quickly.
manipulate/məˈnɪpjuleɪt/操纵/He tried to manipulate the situation.
manner/ˈmænər/方式/She has a pleasant manner.
manufacture/ˌmænjuˈfæktʃər/制造/The factory manufactures electronic products.
margin/ˈmɑːrdʒɪn/边缘；利润/The company's profit margins are very thin.
mass/mæs/大量；质量/A mass of people gathered in the square.
mature/məˈtʃʊr/成熟的/He is mature enough to make his own decisions.
maximum/ˈmæksɪməm/最大值/The maximum speed on this road is 120 km/h.
mechanism/ˈmekənɪzəm/机制/The government introduced a new mechanism.
media/ˈmiːdiə/媒体/Social media has changed how we communicate.
mediate/ˈmiːdieɪt/调解/She mediated between the two parties.
medium/ˈmiːdiəm/中等的/He is of medium height.
memoir/ˈmemwɑːr/回忆录/He published a memoir about his childhood.
merit/ˈmerɪt/优点/She was promoted on her own merits.
